# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Ne pas alerter ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao conserve l'espace de noms métriques de Vault, et un noeud sain et non scellé émet ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, donc une alerte sur ``== 0`` des feux permanents. Utilisation ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 pendant la fermeture); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` des preuves."

# libretranslate
