msgstr "**L'image et la version de dépendance sautent (net depuis 11.6.0):**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Image and dependency version jumps (net since 12.0.0):**"
msgstr "**L'image et la version de dépendance sautent (net depuis 12.0.0):**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Image delivery and frontend dependencies.** Image references now resolve from *meta/services.yml* as their single source of truth, replacing unpinned *latest* tags. *web-app-bigbluebutton* pins its component images separately. *web-svc-cdn* builds and serves mirrored frontend packages through an internal one-shot service, with the package-cache CA trusted by build containers."
