# libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Declares the built-in MCP server at `/api/mcp` over streamable HTTP as an internal, bearer-token-authenticated endpoint, and generates the token that MCP clients present. Adding the MCP Server integration itself stays a Home Assistant onboarding step."
