# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-app RBAC:** Members of `/roles/web-app-kix/administrator` or `/roles/web-app-kix/user` are admitted to KIX; other users are blocked at the OAuth2 proxy. The `user` role is declared via `meta/rbac.yml` so non-admin agents can be granted helpdesk access without bumping them to global administrator."
msgstr "**Par application RBAC:** Membres `/roles/web-app-kix/administrator` ou `/roles/web-app-kix/user` sont admis à KIX; d'autres utilisateurs sont bloqués à l'OAuth2 Le mandataire. Les `user` rôle est déclaré via `meta/rbac.yml` donc les agents non-admin peuvent se voir accorder l'accès helpdesk sans les heurter à l'administrateur global."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-app RBAC:** Members of ``/roles/web-app-kix/administrator`` or ``/roles/web-app-kix/user`` are admitted to KIX; other users are blocked at the OAuth2 proxy. The ``user`` role is declared via ``meta/rbac.yml`` so non-admin agents can be granted helpdesk access without bumping them to global administrator."
