# libretranslate
msgid "Runs [__main__.py](../../../../cli/contributing/network/diagnose/__main__.py) inside the running `infinito` container and produces a structured DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU report against the standard infrastructure hosts (`github.com`, `ghcr.io`, `registry-1.docker.io`, `auth.docker.io`, `pypi.org`, `files.pythonhosted.org`, `registry.npmjs.org`, `objects.githubusercontent.com`, `raw.githubusercontent.com`), separately for IPv4 and IPv6 when available. Extra hosts can be appended via `INFINITO_NET_DEBUG_HOSTS=\"example.com api.example.org\" make diagnose-network`."
msgstr "Cours [main .py](../../../../cli/contributing/network/diagnose/__main__.py) dans la course `infinito` conteneur et produit un rapport structuré DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU par rapport aux hôtes d'infrastructure standard (`github.com`, `ghcr.io`, `registry-1.docker.io`, `auth.docker.io`, `pypi.org`, `files.pythonhosted.org`, `registry.npmjs.org`, `objects.githubusercontent.com`, `raw.githubusercontent.com`), séparément pour IPv4 et IPv6 le cas échéant. Des hôtes supplémentaires peuvent être ajoutés via `INFINITO_NET_DEBUG_HOSTS=\"example.com api.example.org\" make diagnose-network`."

