# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Python source patterns. Dependency declarations MUST live under [`dependencies/`](../../repository/dependencies/); YAML/Jinja patterns MUST live under [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."
msgstr "Tests dans ce répertoire DOIT couvrir uniquement les patrons de sources Python. Déclarations de dépendance [`dependencies/`](../../repository/dependencies/); Les modèles YAML/Jinja DOIVENT vivre sous [`yaml/`](../../repository/yaml/)."

