# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys GitLab from the official Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) CE images at ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` as separate services: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (sole HTTP entry point), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab-sshd) and a one-shot ``migrations`` job. All images share a single version pin (``services.webservice.version``). PostgreSQL, Redis and S3-compatible object storage are wired through the platform lookups (central or sidecar), OIDC and SMTP through the platform SSO and email services. The front proxy terminates TLS and forwards HTTP to workhorse."
msgstr "Ce rôle se déploie GitLab de l'officiel Cloud Native GitLab (GNC) Images CE à ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` en tant que services distincts: ``webservice`` (Puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (unique point d'entrée HTTP), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab-shd) et un seul coup ``migrations`` travail. Toutes les images partagent une seule broche de version (``services.webservice.version``). PostgreSQL, Redis et S3-le stockage d'objets compatibles est câblé à travers les recherches de la plate-forme (central ou sidecar), OIDC et SMTP à travers la plateforme SSO et les services de messagerie. Le proxy frontal met fin à TLS et reporte HTTP vers Workhorse."

