# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Jenkins on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Jenkins image that pre-installs the ``oic-auth``, ``ldap``, ``role-strategy``, and ``configuration-as-code`` plugins, then mounts a JCasC YAML file that wires the security realm against Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) or ``svc-db-openldap`` (variant 1, LDAP). The setup wizard is skipped via ``JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false`` so the JCasC config takes over from first boot."
msgstr "Ce rôle se déploie Jenkins le Docker Compose. Il construit une coutume Jenkins image qui pré-installe le ``oic-auth``, ``ldap``, ``role-strategy``, et ``configuration-as-code`` plugins, puis monte un fichier JCasC YAML qui file le royaume de sécurité contre Keycloak (variante 0, OIDC) ou ``svc-db-openldap`` (variante 1, LDAP). L'assistant de configuration est ignoré via ``JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false`` Donc la configuration JCasC prend le relais du premier démarrage."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Jenkins on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Jenkins image that pre-installs the `oic-auth`, `ldap`, `role-strategy`, and `configuration-as-code` plugins, then mounts a JCasC YAML file that wires the security realm against Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) or `svc-db-openldap` (variant 1, LDAP). The setup wizard is skipped via `JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false` so the JCasC config takes over from first boot."
