msgstr "`true` (insensible aux cas)"

# libretranslate
msgid "`true` = baseline install contract: always installed, MAY omit `enabled`, MUST NOT set `enabled: false`. Also gates install-failure: a failed `required: true` addon hard-fails the play; a failed `required: false` addon warns, is skipped, and the play continues."
msgstr "`true` = contrat d'installation de base: toujours installé, PEUT omettre `enabled`, NE DOIT PAS être réglé `enabled: false`. Egalement portes install-failure: un échec `required: true` addon hard-fails la pièce; un échec `required: false` addon avertit, est sauté, et la pièce continue."

