# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "d'ejabberd `mod_admin` L'interface utilisateur HTTP est la seule surface testable par Playwright ; la connexion du client XMPP elle-même passe 5222/5269 et DOIT être exercée par un XMPP-attention client en dehors de la boucle de test Playwright."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "la seule surface HTTP d'ejabberd est `ejabberd_web_admin` le `/admin` (voir [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). Il authentifie un JID nu contre LDAP sur HTTP Basic, il n'y a donc pas Keycloak rediriger pour suivre et aucun contrôle de déconnexion dans l'application pour cliquer; l'authentification client elle-même passe sur les ports 5222/5269 et reste en dehors de la boucle Playwright, comme indiqué sous Points de veille. `acl.admin` en outre liste seulement l'administrateur JID, donc l'administrateur web refuse tout autre compte carrément. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) en conséquence déclare `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` et `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona et les assertions d'accessibilité de base fonctionnent sans condition."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "les éjabberdes ``mod_admin`` L'interface utilisateur HTTP est la seule surface testable par Playwright ; la connexion du client XMPP elle-même passe 5222/5269 et DOIT être exercée par un XMPP-attention client en dehors de la boucle de test Playwright."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberds seulement la surface HTTP est ``ejabberd_web_admin`` le ``/admin`` (voir ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona et les assertions d'accessibilité de base fonctionnent sans condition."

